e`, and `@google/genai` imports within `server.ts`, as well as how to instantiate the `GoogleGenAI` object with the API key. I\'ve begun to define a function to build the \"Permanent Memory\" context.\n\n\n**Adapting Persona Details**\n\nI\'m now integrating persona adaptation details based on user preferences for language, tone, and grade level. I\'ve successfully incorporated dynamic tone instructions. The system prompt is now more personalized, accounting for language, grade, location, and accessibility needs within the `IDENTITY & PERMANENT MEMORY` section. I\'m focusing on ensuring consistent and appropriate responses from the model.\n\n\n"
